# NOTE: media/ and db.sqlite3 are deliberately still tracked. The database holds
# the demo complaints and references media/complaints/mountain.jpg, so ignoring
# one without the other would give a fresh clone a broken image. For a real
# deployment both should be untracked and backed up instead.

